%% System context: the platform coordinates requests and reviewed delivery.
flowchart LR
    developer["Application developer\nrequests an environment"]
    administrator["Platform administrator\nselects provider and mode"]
    platform["Secure Self-Service\nCloud Platform\nPortal · API · CLI"]
    github["GitHub\nproposal review and\nprotected workflows"]
    aws["AWS installation\noptional real deployment"]
    azure["Azure installation\noptional real deployment"]

    developer -->|request| platform
    administrator -->|configuration| platform
    platform -->|operator carries deterministic bundle| github
    github -.->|approved plan| aws
    github -.->|approved plan| azure

    classDef person fill:#fff7ed,stroke:#c2410c,color:#172033,stroke-width:1px
    classDef system fill:#e8f0fe,stroke:#315c9b,color:#172033,stroke-width:2px
    classDef external fill:#f1f5f9,stroke:#52606d,color:#172033,stroke-width:1px
    class developer,administrator person
    class platform system
    class github,aws,azure external
